        <section xml:id="sec-fun-outcomes">
          <title>Functions of Several Variables</title>
          <introduction><p>Here are the assessment outcomes for Functions of Several Variables. There are multiple versions 
            of each outcome so that there are options for multiple semesters of assessments. This section is 
            divided into 4 outcomes:
            <ul>
              <li><p>Vector Operations and Applications</p></li>
              <li><p>Equations of Lines, Planes, and Surfaces</p></li>
              <li><p>Vector Functions</p></li>
              <li><p>Functions of Two Variables</p></li>
            </ul></p></introduction>
