            <li><p>Partial Derivatives</p></li>
            <li><p>The Chain Rule</p></li>
            <li><p>Gradient, Tangent Lines and Linear Approximations</p></li>
            <li><p>Maxima and Minima</p></li>
            <li><p>Lagrange Multipliers</p></li>
